{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Gif_Short_A_01.gif?t=1743351918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Nomos is a rhythm based action game that blends musical based mechanics with fast-paced hack and slash action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Cello and her gang escape a twisted world full of crazed puppets and a strange magical force called music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Rhythm-infused_Action.png?t=1743351918\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Gif_Short_A_02.gif?t=1743351918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use musical instruments to strike down your stuffed opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You hit harder when your attacks land on beat, feel the groove and play epic solos while dealing massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Interactive_Soundscapes_.png?t=1743351918\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Gif_Short_A_04.gif?t=1743351918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a music-reactive world twisted in time and space by the power of the Alpha Nomos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the environment to get into the rhythm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Puppet_Show_Ever_.png?t=1743351918\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Gif_Short_A_03.gif?t=1743351918\" /></p><p class=\"bb_